  //   with no line (a cross-origin script: the in-app browsers of Instagram and Facebook inject their own) and Java exceptions out of 'iabjs://' -
  //   and four were promise rejections ('No response', 'A network error occurred.') that never stopped the loop. Every one painted GAME ERROR -
  //   SEND THIS LINE TO THE DEV across a phone at wave 0. A foreign error or a rejection goes to the black box and to the board as a QUIET note
