// ══ (STONE TWELVE #33 + #17) THE STREET FINDS ITS VOICE ════════════════════════════════════════════
//   HIS WORD, AND IT OVERTURNS MY OWN EARLIER ROW: *"any living creature should have a voice, plus the
//   machines aswell"* and *"give them voices, write them yourself"*. Row #33 as I first offered it said
//   the other six families should stay SILENT on purpose to keep the street's character. **He ruled the
//   opposite, so the silence goes.** Only the jack boys had a mouth (`JB_TALK`/`JB_TAUNT`/`JB_RESPECT`).
//
//   ⚠ **ONE TABLE, ONE DOOR, AND THE STREET'S EXISTING GOVERNOR — never eight bark sites bolted into
//   eight state machines.** #17's own words are *"wired through the same bark governor so the street's
