  //       a platinum standing 260px from the pilot went a full minute without a word;
  //     · a bounded scan for the first body that CAN speak -> worse, not better: the near cluster is
  //       popcorn and drones, so they took every opening and FOUR families went silent.
  //   **Whoever is nearest is not whoever is owed a turn.** The tick now walks the FAMILY list and asks
