//  tier a player already has. That is what makes `tools/pixel.js` drift-0 achievable on a stone that touches
//  a draw organ, and it is why the early return is the first line rather than a branch further down.
//
//  **IT IS A REGISTRY, NOT A SCATTER — his order's own word.** Every decorative allowance names itself in
//  `QREG` with its MEDIUM and LOW shares. An unregistered name gets **1 at every tier** — it is never
//  silently trimmed — and `drawsim [QT]` refuses the file the moment a gated site cites a name the registry
//  does not carry. So a new effect must declare itself, and the tier system cannot rot quietly.
//
//  ⚠ **AND IT RIDES POOL CAPS, NEVER SPAWN COUNTS, WHICH IS THE WHOLE REASON THIS IS SAFE.** Trap #395:
//  `spawnParticle` ITSELF rolls, so spawning fewer of something shifts every downstream `Math.random()` and
