//  eighth, 2026-09-01: FLENSE's slab chips; the ninth, same day: THE FUSE EMBERS — both trim the sparks
//  pool through the same qCap(spectacle) door spawnSparks already used, and drawsim [QT] clause 8
//  counted each drift the hour it landed, exactly as designed.)
//  ⚠ THIS LINE HAS NOW BEEN WRONG TWICE AND A LAW GUARDS IT, WHICH IS THE ONLY REASON TO TRUST IT.
//  The tiers stone claimed eight sites, five caps and three bounds. THE FREE PASS (1 of 5) corrected the
//  TOTAL to seven and left the SPLIT at four/three — while that same stone was moving `loottrail` from the
//  bound column into the cap column, which is precisely what changed the split. **A correction that
