//   ruled, in writing, what the shortest window a pilot can ACT inside is: `MIRBRAIN.REACT` is 0.18s and
//   is called *"the pilot's own read lag"*; `PLAT_PGN_GAP` clears it by 22% precisely so *"each round in
//   the ripple is a thing he can see and answer"*, and `BFST.HOLD` cites the same constant for *"a stance
//   that flips faster than a man can read is a flicker."* A telegraph shorter than that is not a
