  //   SIZE: 1.3175 = 1.55 x 0.85 — G27 (the director, 2026-08-20: "magenta lab too big make it 15 percent
  //   smaller"). It no longer beats the FOREMAN reach (`1.22 * 1.15 = 1.403`) — his order outranks that
  //   ELITE-DOCTRINE relation — but still clears the largest ordinary roll (1.15) by 14.6%, past the 4-5%
  //   dead zone `tools/eye-grade.js` names. **The toughness did NOT shrink with it (his round-9 ruling):**
  //   `hp * sz * sz` now prices 1.74x by size, and `HEAVY_TANK` rose in the same edit so the total holds.
  //   TINT: derived off the asset, never chosen by eye. `double-jump/assets/labmachine.webp` carries 43.4%
  //   of its saturated pixels at hue 150-180deg, so the hull reads TEAL and the +-22 jitter never leaves
  //   143-187. **-60 rotates the dominant band to ~105 (green):** 2.7x the jitter half-width, 56deg off the
