// ══ THE STATE READ (BOOK II #311, TRAIL 2/5) — direction §7 in `foreman/plans/GRUDGE-TRAIL.md`
//
// **THE BAR THE ORDER SET:** *"a pilot reads its state from the trail alone, with the body off-screen."*
