// −0.10; continuous decay 0.08/s toward ×1.0; clamp [×1.0, ×3.0]. Diamond DROPS multiply by the
// meter (fraction rolled). MILESTONES pop visible loot — "that way you can see you're doing good":
// upward crossings pay WATCH(10) at ×1.5 and ×2.5, CHAIN(25) at ×2.0 and ×3.0; every 15-kill
