    // own corpse-cap logic lives behind it. Firing per-frame-held would pay a pilot for standing in a state
    // rather than for entering it, which is the class `STYLE.sinceHit` and the CHAIN counter both exist to stop.
    //
    // (#148 THE LEG 8 CRITIC, v1.6.558) THE CORPSE CAP IS RESET FIRST, AND WITHOUT THIS LINE THE TRICK WAS
