//  dials, #108's ring dials): a writable ENEMY dial that a scored run honours is a cheat door, and forcing
//  `SANDBOX.on = false` in a wave run is precisely the lock that makes the scoreboard mean anything. What criterion A
//  actually catches is a caption that LIES about wave behaviour — and every one of these three says, in its own
