    // timer, so the game's single most rewarding window was invisible. `DOOR9` two thousand lines away has
    // shaken its staggered body since it shipped (`jit9`), which is the in-file model this copies.
    // **A JITTER IS CORRECT HERE AND IT WAS WRONG ONE STONE AGO, WHICH IS WORTH SAYING OUT LOUD:** #231 just
