// **THE MULTIPLIER IS BOUNDED BY THE CEILING, NOT BY TASTE**: the band's own top (1000) times the cell must
// stay under 2200, so 2.2 is the arithmetic roof and 1.9 ships with 300px of room. The pilot's honest reach
