// ══ THE VERTICAL WAR (his order 2026-09-05, verbatim: *"I want all of my enemies to be able to chase me to the very top,
//   every single one. I don't want any exceptions."*) THE ARRIVAL RIDES HIS ALTITUDE: the sky families used to arrive
