// **EIGHT `else if` ARMS BECAME ONE TABLE AND ONE CODE PATH.** `wrunCompose` carried THE TEAR, FIRST
// BLOOD, THE WALL, THE PRIESTHOOD, LAB TRAX, EVERYTHING, the brawl seasoning and the standard
// wave as a chain of branches, each composing its own mix its own way — which is why the sky floor, the
// debut door and the proportional fit reached exactly ONE of them (the standard branch) and the other
