  //    PUSH TIME through `wrunEdgeX`, so touching the push order moves every body's x and everything
  //    downstream of the stream. `[GLC]` convicted it in one run — THE GLASS CANNON's swept income ratio fell
  //    1.40+ -> 1.229 at seed 77 — and the law's own cure line said "re-run the sweep rather than lowering
  //    the floor", which would have been tuning a design cell to chase re-rolled dice. THE TWO STREAMS LAW
  //    (STAGECRAFT #3) is the house rule this broke: a new feature never rolls the seed lock's dice.
  //    So: push exactly as before (identical draws, identical x, identical flights at identical indices),
  //    record each family's slot range, then REORDER THE CLOSURES between those slots. A permutation of an
