  //        wave 12 —    62 entries, period 1.452s -> the 22 rabbis' block is 30.5s of 90s (33.9%)
  //        wave 29 — 2,466 entries, period 0.036s -> the 50 rabbis' block is  1.8s of 90s ( 2.0%)
  //
  //    A block is only a wall once the period is too short for a pilot to read arrivals as separate events,
  //    and **this game already ships that number**: `RB_TELE_MIN` (0.35s) is the floor on a warning a pilot
