  //    become slabs; at or over it the block IS the phase, which is the shipped feel `[RBP]` graded at w12
  //    and shipped. So `T / entries >= RB_TELE_MIN` leaves the queue exactly as it was pushed.
  //    **WHAT THIS BUYS, and it is the reason the gate exists rather than being tidiness:** every wave under
