  //   ENRAGE NEVER FIRED AGAIN for the rest of the run — and below four, his own priest got `__straggle`,
  //   snarled, and the lane printed THE LAST OF THEM RUN over a hireling. The wave-clear counter thirty
  //   lines away always did it right (`!allyBody(z)`). One clause — the NINTH shipping of this exact missing
  //   clause, which is why `devsim [CEN]` now sweeps every `for (... of enemies)` for a team test.
  // (stone H, #49) The count was taken on the leash pass above, under the IDENTICAL filter — including the
