  //   inventing a boss the engine cannot open would be a mechanic nobody built (#371). So this reads as an
  //   ABSENCE and never as a billing: the name is QUOTED, and the clause after the em-dash is lower case.
  //   **Re-using #571's own floater wording (`NO SUCH BOSS — THE PERCH BOSS`) would red that clause.**
