  //   announced "RABBIS JOIN THE HUNT" ten waves after he had fought rabbis, and his REFLECTION at 7 and 11
  //   got no preview at all. THE PRECEDENCE, ruled out loud and inherited from #499's tear grammar and
  //   #509's *"an extrapolated wave yields to a NAMED one — HE TYPED THOSE WAVES"*: **the authored row
  //   OVERRIDES the ladder wherever one exists**, and where it does not (the named milestones w25/30/35/40,
  //   where `waveMapRow` returns null by `[15]`'s own law) the ladder keeps its word untouched below.
