//   matter still in the air so the intermission reads as a ceasefire instead of a freeze-frame of
//   incoming fire. It clears `bullets` (the hostile drone-shot array, whole) and the hostile-OWNED
//   entries of `pulses` — never the pilot's own, which is a behaviour change nobody ordered and which
