// **IT RETURNS A REASON RATHER THAN A BOOLEAN, AND THAT IS THE HALF THAT PAYS.** A boolean would have removed
// the duplication and left the diagnosis exactly where it was: `[IH2]`'s old failure line read *"the clear bell
// never reached the shop … in 400 frames"*, which is true, useless, and cost a stone its whole overage. A law
// that can print WHICH condition is holding turns that stall into one line.
