// `if (WAVEQ.q.length === 0) { …four booleans… }`, so the queue was a fifth condition wearing a different
// shape. `[AB5]` asserts the BEHAVIOUR — no bell may ring with a body still queued — and its reason is worth
// keeping in front of whoever edits this next: *a stalled queue plus an empty field is exactly what a pilot
// holding TIME SLOW through the last kill produces, and a bell there would arm the ceasefire, heal him, and
// then deliver the wave.* Folding it in changes no behaviour and makes the list complete for the first time.
//
