      note: 'REPLAY: load the page with window.__TRAX_TAPE = tape.seed set BEFORE game.js, then feed dt[i]/dtScale and the inp[i] bits frame by frame. The seed must be installed before source-eval or the module-eval dice (pigeon roosts, gems, flocks, sky) are already spent — #528 measured that three ways.',
