  //   announce site by the SOURCE EXPRESSION of its `text:` — its header says it falls back to the
  //   enclosing function name, but the code only does that for owners starting `dev`, so a bare
  //   `text: msg` falls through every rule to the COLOUR catch-all and `[ANN]` reds the lane. Carrying
