  // It read `H * 0.72   // well below the SAVE button (H*0.60 + 50)` — true at 720p and 1080p and FALSE
  // below H=508, because the two seats converge: `0.72H - 11 < 0.6H + 50` whenever `0.12H < 61`. Measured
  // at 1280x480 the legend sat **3px inside the button**, and at 1280x320 fifteen. It survived the gate on
  // a technicality: `[FIT19]`'s `GRACE = 3` tests `> GRACE`, so a 3.0px overlap passes by exactly zero
  // margin — and `[FIT19]` never compared text against `WMODE.btns` at all, so the whole class was
  // invisible. **A fraction is not a seat when the thing above it is also a fraction.** #163 learned the
  // same lesson on the shop felt one stone earlier and this block did not inherit it.
