    // ── THE BIG MOMENTS: THE SLAB JOINS THE STANDARD (book stone 8) ──────────────────────
    //   HIS E21: "death: ONE SCREEN, THREE PANELS." HIS E23: "HOW FAR YOU GOT is the headline (biggest),
