  //   card PLATINUM ESCORT is a green card, every price pill on every card is the same green, and the NEXT
  //   WAVE button is green — so the one card whose identity is green is the one card a stranger would most
  //   reasonably read as 'this is the affordable one'."* Once #328 gave the BORDER to the family, that
  //   collision got worse, not better: the ally's identity green and the price's state green now sit on the
  //   same card.
  //   **THE FIX IS TO COLOUR THE EXCEPTION, NOT THE NORM.** A shop where you can afford most things paints
  //   eleven pills green to say nothing. Pink still means CANNOT — the one fact a price has to shout — and
  //   affordable goes to `#ffe9a3` — **the colour the card's own NAME is already drawn in, four lines up**,
  //   so no new hex enters the palette and the pill reads as text rather than as a signal. **AND THE HONEST
  //   CAVEAT: that cream sits at LIGHTNING's hue.** It is not a collision — saturation 0.36 against
  //   LIGHTNING's 0.71, on a black plate, in the corner of a card rather than across its ribbon and border —
  //   but it is a shared hue and saying otherwise would be the kind of comment #322 shipped and had to
  //   correct. **Green now means ALLY, and only ALLY, anywhere on the felt.**
  ctx.fillStyle = S.canBuy ? '#ffe9a3' : '#ff9db1';
  fitPut(surf, id + '-price', pr, px2 + pw / 2, py2 + CA.PRICE - Math.round(6 * sc), pw - 8, Math.round(13 * sc), '700', 'center', 'rgba(8,10,18,0.85)');
  // (G20) FROM WHAT TO WHAT — the live now-to-next readout rides the price row's empty left half, in
  // its own measured zone (never appended into cap: capBudget cuts appended text at laptop heights).
  if (S.readout) {
    ctx.fillStyle = S.locked ? 'rgba(255,233,163,0.4)' : S.broke ? 'rgba(255,233,163,0.45)' : '#ffe9a3';
    fitPut(surf, id + '-now', S.readout, x + CA.PAD, py2 + CA.PRICE - Math.round(6 * sc), Math.max(24, px2 - 8 - (x + CA.PAD)), Math.round(11 * sc), '700', 'left');
  }
  // the ⓘ, top-right, inside the ribbon
  ctx.fillStyle = S.noteOpen ? '#0b0f1a' : 'rgba(10,14,26,0.7)';
  fitPut(surf, id + '-note', 'ⓘ', x + w - Math.round(15 * sc), y + CA.RIB - Math.round(5 * sc), Math.round(20 * sc), Math.round(11 * sc), '700', 'center', live ? K.col : K.dim);
  ctx.textAlign = 'center';
  if (HUDLAB.probe) (HUDLAB.cards = HUDLAB.cards || []).push({ surf, id, k: card.k, kind: card.kind || null, ribbon: K.label, fam: K.fam || null, col: K.col, x, y, w, h, glyph: true, price: S.price, locked: !!S.locked, broke: !!S.broke });
