// and this is that sentence spoken by a factory. Three layers: a SUB KNELL at 48->24Hz held 1.15s (the
// generic machine boom is 60->30 over 0.7s, so this is deeper and 1.6x longer), a DOOR-CLOSING stroke at
// 262->104Hz, and a torn-hull noise tail.
//
// **IT IS QUIETER THAN THE SOUND IT PLAYS UNDER, ON PURPOSE.** Its loudest layer is 0.095 against the
// sub-70Hz platinum hit door's 0.11 — the declared band in this stone's DIRECTION. A super's death already
