// ═══ THE TOLL (BOOK II #330, RABBI DEATH 2/5) ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//   The order: *"RULE WHETHER IT IS SILENT. THE PRIESTHOOD event exists; a death that echoes it would tie
//   the family together."* **RULED: NOT SILENT, and the reason is that the family already has a chord.**
//   `SFX.stPriest` is the wave sting for THE PRIESTHOOD — G4/B4/D5 (392/494/588), rising triangles, the
//   loudest single voice on the wave bus at -16.63 dBFS. The priesthood ARRIVES on a major triad and until
//   now it DEPARTED on `rbSput`, a 0.14s sawtooth misfire that is a marksman's death and not a family's.
//   **THE TOLL IS THAT CHORD ANSWERED: the same three pitch classes an OCTAVE DOWN (G3/B3/D4), arriving in
//   DESCENDING order, decaying four times as long.** Rising triad = they have come. Falling triad = one has
//   gone. It is deliberately the same triangle timbre for the top two voices, because the ear recognises an
//   answer by timbre as much as by pitch, and a sine underneath for weight.
//   **AND IT IS QUIETER THAN THE ARRIVAL BY DESIGN (bar 2): 0.055/0.05/0.04 against stPriest's
//   0.09/0.08/0.07.** An arrival outranks a departure; a death louder than the family's own entrance is a
//   mis-ranked event, and this floor has the severity register precisely so that ranking is deliberate.
//   It is positioned (`x: hx`) where the sting is not — the sting is the whole street's news, a death is
//   one man's, and `rbPresence` already carries that distinction in the other direction.
//   ⚠ **AND THE THIRD IS FLATTENED, WHICH IS THE WHOLE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN A KNELL AND A DISMISSAL.** My
//   first cut was the major triad transposed down, and a cold read of the DIRECTION — before a line was
//   built — refused it: *"a falling major triad is not a death knell, it is the most common cadence in the
//   entire vocabulary of DISMISSAL: menu-back, purchase-complete, item-sold... the document has made the
//   family tie a bar and thereby outlawed sorrow."* Correct, and the cure is not to abandon the tie but to
//   spend ONE note of it: **G3 and D4 are held exactly (root and fifth, the family), and B natural becomes
//   B FLAT (233Hz).** Same chord, one note grieved. It is a stronger tie than a transposition, because a
