  // lab row; grudges stamp `sui: true` (never `e.grudge`) and fell to street. The body's own `fam`
  // stamp — spawn-authored on every wave body — is the truth the ladder was approximating, so a
  // named row matches it FIRST and the ladder stands as the fallback for unstamped bodies.
  if (e.fam && TREASURE_CHARACTER[e.fam]) return e.fam;
