  // edit on the variant table rather than a code change. It ships at 1.0 across the board on purpose: the
  // per-variant economy is the director's to shape, and a column nobody has ruled on should change nothing.
  //   rich > 1  shifts weight OFF the coin and ONTO the colour, proportionally, without touching the bands.
  //   rich < 1  does the reverse: a poorer variant rains more copper.
