      // gone — that was a tap with a slow thumb, not a cage. Give the pilot the bolt he asked for,
      // hand back the upkeep the cage spent, and let the cage never have counted. The `!SHOCK.absorbed`
      // guard is the honest edge: if it managed to drink something in those frames it WAS a cage, and a
      // cage with a tab pays its tab.
      SHOCK.juice = Math.min(SHK.JUICE, SHOCK.juice + graceT);
