if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.SEIZELOOK = SEIZELOOK;
// THE RIM'S ANSWER (his ruling, 2026-08-24, verbatim: "the strike hits the rim and then we are talking
// about its return fir discharge that should come from the rim"). Every answer the cage gives — the
// retal bite, the salvo's first hop — used to leave from the CAGE'S CENTER (player.x, y-70). The shell
