  //   `enemies[]` BY DESIGN** (see the standing note at `nearestTarget`), so this filter dropped him before
  //   any damage call existed to route, and the salvo took the `if (!live.length)` crackle-and-waste exit.
  //   MEASURED before this edit, driving the shipped `orbStrike(24)` with him as the only body on the field:
  //   **`shockCascade` queued 0, three stray crackle arcs, none aimed at him, his hp 2000 -> 2000.** The same
  //   salvo with one ordinary jack boy present queued 24 and killed it. The pilot pays TWO cards
  //   (`wrunHas('shock')` for the cage, `wrunHas('orb')` for the hold) for a bank that cannot touch the boss.
  //   The push is `shockChainTargets`' own line, verbatim — three of the storm's four emitters already carry
  //   it and building a fourth shape here would be the crime PRIOR ART names.
  const live = enemies.filter(e => e.state !== 'die' && !allyBody(e));   // (#560)
