    //   answers THE PAVEMENT for LAB TRAX at every altitude, because he has no `dy` at all - he
    //   carries an absolute `y`. Measured airborne before this edit: painted at 590 while his centre was
    //   325, **264px low**. On the sand the two answers are 15px apart, which is how it survived.
    //   ⚠ THE ORDINARY ARM IS BYTE-FOR-BYTE UNCHANGED, ON PURPOSE. `bodyCY(e)` is the shipped helper for
