// `notes/FORGE-LOOK.md` §5 rules the picture (the band warms, the stars go out, the screen pulses) and
// `notes/FORGE-SOUND.md` §4 rules the voice to the hertz (990 → 880 → 660, a ladder that DESCENDS). Nothing
