// WHY THIS IS A SECOND POOL AND NOT A CALL INTO `shockArcs`, AND THE REASON IS A RECEIPT RATHER THAN A
// PREFERENCE. I tried the reuse first, exactly as THE PRIOR ART LAW asks: lift the arc renderer into one
