    //   was fine and the CONTRAST was not: *"the interior is inert … one flat colour end to end. No
    //   darker core, no brighter lip. A real closed wound has a centre that differs from its edges."* And
    //   then, plainly: *"if you only get one change, take the core over the width."* So the lens is the
    //   deep's teal LIP and a dark CORE runs down the middle of it. The geometry did not move — it is
    //   already ~14px at the belly at the moment anybody looks at the site, which is the reader's own
    //   13-15px target; what was missing was anything to see across it.
    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(' + TEARVIEW.GLOW + ',' + ((0.30 + 0.35 * k52) * fade52).toFixed(3) + ')';
