    //   burning lie visibly falters. It is READ by the draw, never by the pull: the odds are `flrRand`'s and
    //   this is only their portrait.
    //   **THE SWING IS 0.45-1.00, NOT 0.62-0.95, AND MY OWN LAW CAUGHT THE FIRST CUT.** [BRN] clause 1 reds under
    //   a 0.3 swing and the first beat delivered 0.245 - a ripple, not a falter. A cold reader had measured the
