  //   because a wave owed exactly one; since #438 a wave owes many, and the mix is the point — the
  //   free grab and the fuel question have to be able to sit in the same wave.
  // ══ THE SKY MEETS HIM (G4) — HIS ORDER: "they should also spawn in the sky when your there." A NEW
  //   door BESIDE `shmDyFor` (the [HGH] band premise is untouched): when the pilot is genuinely aloft,
  //   an arrival that would have seated BELOW him is lifted to his own altitude instead — wave-keyed
  //   jitter, no dice, same determinism the seat has always had. An arrival already higher stays higher.
  let dyG4 = shmDyFor(waves.n, WRUN.shmSeq);
