  //   ⚠ 0.34 -> 0.22 AFTER LOOKING. At 0.34 the bow is 3.6px on a 21px body and the quadratic control point
  //   doubles it, which photographed as a SWOOSH across the stone rather than as a rim seen at an angle —
  //   the teal read as a paper dart. 0.22 still bows the girdle unmistakably and keeps it a rim.
  const bow = tilt * 0.22 * rr;
