  // (#339 SECOND PASS) HOISTED OUT OF THE FACET LOOP, and it is loop-invariant by inspection: `cutBlink`
  //   reads `lightPhase` and nothing else, so the body below was paying SIX identical `Math.pow(|cos|, 8)`
  //   calls per stone per frame where one does. Provably identical output, and `LABDEATH.CAP` puts 28 of
  //   these in the air at once - 168 pow calls a frame against 28. Found by `budgetsim [MF]` naming LAB the
  //   heaviest family on a mixed field, which is the bar that separates "heaviest" from "unaffordable".
  const bl = cutBlink(lightPhase);
