// `notes/HEAR-RIG.md`'s determinism trap says a band narrower than the rig's own 1.15 dB spread is a coin
// flip — so it is declared as **-26..-22 dBFS** and the capture is what says whether it landed.
//
// THE SHAPE: a low struck note that RISES, because everything else this fight says descends. The dread
