  //   climbs to ~1.75 at ten — `sqrt` because ten lanes are not ten times the event and a linear term
  //   would put a flash the width of the pilot on the roof of a ladder he is meant to keep climbing.
  //   Everything the flash already owns scales by it and NOTHING new is drawn: same rays, same core, same
  //   two shimmer rings, same alpha ramp. **A tap still looks like a tap.**
