  //   cut scaled the core's RADIUS by `gr` and left its gradient alone — the same energy spread over a
  //   larger disc, so at six lanes the reader measured *"paler, flatter, more transparent... no hot core at
  //   all. Six lanes bought a wider smear of weaker fire. Peak brightness went DOWN."* **A bigger explosion
  //   that is cooler at its centre is backwards**, and it is the exact failure the rays had too (length
  //   scaled, width did not, so they thinned into whiskers).
  //   THE CURE IS TWO BODIES, NOT ONE: the BLOOM grows with `gr` as before, and a WHITE HEART is drawn over
  //   it at very nearly the base radius. The heart is what a stranger reads as heat, and it is the one thing
  //   in this flash that must never dim as the weapon gets bigger.
