    // twin-rack or a wide spread puts more lead in the air per trigger pull and must be judged on all of
    // it, or a scattergun build would read as a marksman. Accuracy is the PULSE's alone and that is a
    // ruling — it is the only weapon every run owns from the first frame (`wrunLockerTake`: "pulse and
    // basic jetpack only") and the only one that is a discrete aimed shot. Rockets are area, the storm is
    // a cascade, melee is not aimed; averaging them would give a number no pilot could act on.
    if (WRUN.on) WRUN.shots++;
