// hand-typed rgb(1,44,128) while the art's top row measures ~rgb(1,45,133) — a +5 blue step plus
// texture-stopping-dead on one line, riding down the frame for the whole climb (alt ~2,100 to
// ~11,000). Sampled from the art at load so the fill can never disagree with the painting it
// extends; ONE flat color, never a gradient — his "you fucked my sky" ruling stands. The literal
// stays as the fallback for the headless gate (no WebP decode there — byte-identical laws).
let sbZenith = 'rgb(1,44,128)';
