// not about the sky's look at all: DRAWSKYCLOUDS() SAT INSIDE THE CITY GATE, so on the DESERT — the
// stage this entire direction is written for — draw() painted NO CLOUD AT ALL, for three stones, and
// on the city it painted the sky IN FRONT of the buildings. Both cured by moving the sky pass under
// the lens; both now held by drawsim [DT]. THE SKYLINE'S HIGH DECK IS RULED, not inherited onward:
