// the same shape as the guard's existing action on the particle pool. Three properties it is built
// to have, each one a rule this floor has already paid for:
//   · IT NEVER WRITES A DIAL. The pilot's SKYCLOUD.DENS is his; a system that quietly rewrites a
//     saved setting is the D008 class this factory has already chased once. The shed is read at
//     draw time and leaves every tunable exactly where the pilot left it.
//   · IT KEEPS ALL THREE DECKS. #76's depth ladder is the sky's whole legibility, so the cut is
//     taken per layer and every layer keeps at least one body: a thinner sky, never a flatter one.
//   · IT IS DETERMINISTIC AND STABLE. The kept bodies are the first N of each deck in the array's
//     own order, so the same clouds stay up frame after frame — a random cut would strobe.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// THE DENSITY BUDGET (BOOK II stone 4, v1.6.519) — **A REGISTER OVER SIX GOVERNORS, NOT A SEVENTH.**
// The order's first line is the one that matters: *"A new parallel governor is the named crime; the deliverable
