// own breath: the centreline is displaced by `sin` at `SKYCLOUD.BOB`, amplitude one base-width, growing with
// height so the foot stays planted and the top wanders. THE LEAN IS THE WIND, signed, so a devil always
// leans the way the weeds roll — a second wind in one desert is the crime [GS] fails a cloud shadow for.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// THE AIR OF THE PLACE (BOOK II #234) — the ninth rider, and it spends NO dice at all
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// **THE PREMISE IS CONFIRMED: nothing in this game moves unless the pilot moves it.** The dust needs his
// feet, the downwash his jets, the devil is an event, the weeds need a gust. Stand still on the desert and
// the air is empty. This is the rider that makes the air itself alive.
//
// CLAUSE B — **ZERO DICE, WHICH IS `DEVIL`'S OWN STANDARD AND STRICTLY STRONGER THAN OWNING A STREAM.**
// There is no `Math.random`, no `atmRand`, no `dustRand` anywhere in this system. A mote's whole life is a
