//
// CLAUSE C — **THE RATE IS A CLOCK THIS DESERT ALREADY KEEPS, AND THE DUTY CYCLE IS 100% BY DESIGN.**
// `DEVIL` derives its birth rate from `SKYCLOUD.BOB / 2π` — one event per cloud-breath — because a devil
