      // second cold read said so in the plainest words available: *"every one presents a closed, near-circular
      // outer envelope as its strongest read."* **A DERIVED FLOOR IS NOT A TARGET** — this room has now paid for
      // that sentence three times (the brush root, the bone, and here), and it is the same mistake each time:
