  //                  of four alike — IS UNREACHABLE FOR A PER-CELL HASH OVER AN UNBOUNDED FIELD, and the cure
  //                  that would reach it is the one ruled out below: stratification bands the desert.
  //                  expressible, largest allowed — and the SECOND half of that was mine. A cold reader graded
  //                  the four benched slots at ship size and counted **THREE ROCKS, NOT FOUR**: apexes at 0.411,
  //                  0.508, 0.581 and 0.614 of the width, and *"rocks 1 and 2 are one rock drawn twice with the
