// weber 52.9% against the sand they land on — SIX TIMES the loudest atmosphere signal on this desert (#77's
// shadows read 8.5%). What the frames showed instead is that TWO of the four kinds could not RESOLVE, and the
// cause in both is the same and it is arithmetic: THEIR FEATURES WERE SPACED TIGHTER THAN THEIR OWN PEN.
//   · the BONE drew 5 ribs across w*0.64 = 36px on a 3px pen: a pitch of 2.4 pen widths, which is a hatch
//     rather than a rib cage — and its skull was a 1:1 filled ellipse, which at 14px is a ball. The director
//     called the result "grey spiked artifacts" (D005 -> D011) and `canon/README.md` lists it as NOT canon.
//   · the BRUSH drew 9 stems on a h*0.05 = 1.7px pen — a hair at 1x — with tips 4.4px apart: 1.3 pen widths,
//     so six of the nine merged into one fan-shaped smudge.
