  // filled path, so its silhouette was pure line and every pixel of it was pen-width.** The precedent is
  // forty lines below, in the bone's own header: #81 graded that kind FAIL and wrote the rule — "a bone that
  // reads wants to be a FILLED SHAPE, not a line drawing, and that is a re-sculpt, not a tune." The bone got
  // its mass at #81. The brush was the last wire drawing left in the set.
  //
