// almost level, and two dark hollows. THE BOX IS UNCHANGED at 64 x 26 — D044's stature fork is unruled, so
// this sculpt may not buy its reading with size and does not.
//
// WHY A SKULL AND NOT BONES: the order's word is "bones", which names a MATERIAL rather than a shape, and at
// 22 screen px the readable noun for desert bones is the horned skull — one solid silhouette with two holes
// in it, rather than an assembly of parts each thinner than the nib. A second element beside it (a scattered
// long bone, a pelvis) is REFUSED on #81's own finding: more pieces at this size is the same
