  //                 #ears' SFX.flutter — the defect is in the pigment, so no knob could reach it.
  //                 THE CURE IS DERIVED AND SYMMETRIC, not chosen: the DARK grain #d3b485 sits 31.7
  //                 levels BELOW that sand (luminance 183.9), which is the separation the author already
