// ⚠⚠ **`PAINTERS` IS NOT SEATED, AND THE REASON IS A MEASUREMENT, NOT A BUDGET.** It was built, it ran, and
//   it was REVERTED: with skyclouds and vultures moved into a table — each carrying its own atm bracket, the
