// ══ THE CONTROL STRIP FADES (STONE EIGHT, row #56) ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
// **IT IS NOT DELETED AND THAT IS THE RULING.** The strip is the one surface in this game that never told
// a lie — it has said DOUBLE-TAP DASH since it was written, while the pause card said SHIFT — so it earns
// its minute. After that it is a debug artifact sitting in every frame of a commercial screenshot, which
