    //   forever after a single blast and the pilot drifts by a rounding error for the rest of the run.
    //   FOUR SIMS RED ON THAT: dreamsim [P12] read "parking went unpunished" because a pilot standing still
    //   was still technically moving, and barragesim/squadsim/pendantsim leaked the residue across fixtures
    //   (the same clause failed in two different places on two runs — the tell that it was STATE, not logic).
    //   The idiom this rode in on already solved it, at the enemy loop's tail, in its own words:
