      liveD++; if (gy4 - p.y > highD) highD = gy4 - p.y;
      // and THE DOWNWASH's own two, because door 2 has its own ceilings to answer for (drawsim [DW]).
      // Measured off groundY() like its sibling, which is the true floor on the desert by FIX-AND-FORWARD
      // #5 (the plane is FLAT) — over a city rooftop this number reads the roof's height too, so [DW]
