    // THE TILE SEAM (THE TEN WORST: THE DESERT, cure 3). The sand is tiled at exact tile width under the
    // world lens, which is a NON-INTEGER scale — so every 1024 world px the resampler left a one-pixel
    // column of the base coat showing through as a dark hairline running the full height of the near
