  player: 'Your own body: movement, jumps, the jet, the dash, the veil’s dev base, the camera lead — plus the melee ruling, the strike’s momentum, hearts, and the mercy window. The wardrobe and flight deck below dress and drill it. Try: VEILSPEED and VEILSTEER with THE CROSS.',
