  setter: 'The back room museum’s own numbers: each exhibit hangs its dials here as it opens, ghost health to counterfeit sting. The exhibits’ BEHAVIOR is the living kit at shipped numbers — only their pools and cons are dialed. Try: FAKES PER PLANT at 10 against THE FORGER.',
