// AND ONE ROW PER TIMED KIND OF #102's STORE. THE ICONS ARE PLACEHOLDERS AND SAY SO IN THEIR OWN FLAG:
// each kind's stone (#105–#111) owns its body and its glyph, and a room that let these ship unmarked
// would hand the next room a finished-looking icon nobody designed. What is REAL here is that the chip
