const HYPEBAR = { H: 58, Y: 292, W: 800, LEN: 2.6, PAD: 18, SLIDE: 58, SLIDE_T: 0.14, EASE: 2.3, KIN: 6, RING_T: 0.55, GAP: 0.35, DEPTH: 4 };
// (#122) THE QUEUE. **`hypeRaise` did not stack into noise — it OVERWROTE.** A second raise assigned `HYPE.text` over
//  the first, so a banner could be destroyed mid-slide or mid-sentence and the pilot never learned it existed. Silent
//  loss is worse than clutter, because clutter at least tells you something happened.
//   · `GAP 0.35` is the frequency floor: seconds of clear air after one band leaves before the next may rise. It is
