const HYPEQ = { q: [], cool: 0, led: { raised: 0, queued: 0, evicted: 0, shown: 0 } };
const HYPE = { text: '', t: 0, y: 0, land: 0 };   // (#121) `y` is the live seat offset, `land` the frame the slide finished
// (#122) **THESE FOUR ARE WAVE-LIVE, AND THAT IS A RULING RATHER THAN AN EXCEPTION.** I refused a wave-live dial three
//  times this room (#115, #116, #120) under THE NO-CHEAT LAW — and every one was an ENEMY dial: cap, hp, curve,
//  density, where a writable value a scored run honours is a cheat door. **A banner's dwell changes no difficulty.**
//  The lock protects the scoreboard from dials that move the FIGHT; it was never a rule against dials that move a
