      //      This line read `mk.curtain ? '#9be8ff' : '#ff8f88'` with the comment *"the line is the forge's
      //      blue"* — which is exactly the defect, stated as if it were the reason. A COLD READER given only
      //      the frames and no source: *"the five-circle line is drawn in the player's own colour… I can see
      //      five circles; nothing tells me they mean 'damage lands here'."* **AND THE TREE AGREES IN
