      //      keeps a PIP-CYAN REGISTER over `#9be8ff`, and `notes/ELITE-DOCTRINE.md` §92 names it *"the UI
      //      cyan"* across 19 sites. The pilot's health bar, his three pips, the horizon hairline and the
      //      boss pen are all that hue. A warning painted in the friendly colour, at construction-line
